# Perforating Artist: Bot2 controls an Island and nothing else, so a nonland permanent can't be sacrificed - the Island is not
# among them - and the sacrifice choice is refused. It chooses to discard a card instead and loses no life: the Artist's 3 combat
# damage is all it took (17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Perforating Artist
Ornithopter
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
